                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On March 17 Clay held a top secret
                    teletype conference with Voorhees
                    concerning the general trend of events in Germany and the negotiation <pb
                        facs="0610" n="573" xml:id="pg573"/> in London on prohibited and restricted
                    industries. For the transcript of this conference, see <ref target="#pg105">page
                        105</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
